{% doc %}
  The theme's drawn glyphs: the filled 32px icon-ring icons of the Shop by
  category tabs, and the 20px trust icons of the Icon with text row. Each
  keeps the coordinates it was drawn at and is framed by its own viewBox.
  Anything not listed here falls back to the theme's stroke icons.

  @param {string} icon - energy | gut | skin | aging | weight | sleep | stress | female | male | joints | trust-pure | trust-verified | trust-tested | trust-shipping | trust-save, or any `icon` snippet name
  @param {number} [size] - Pixel size. Default 32.
  @param {string} [class] - Extra classes

  @example
    {% render 'icon-goal', icon: 'gut', size: 32 %}
{% enddoc %}

